# README footer

- Never paste the disclaimer paragraphs directly into README bodies.
- Footer source of truth: `internal/readme-footer.md` (gitignored folder).
- After creating or editing any `README.md` or `*-README.md`, run: `python3 internal/sync-readme-footers.py`
- To change footer text globally, edit only `internal/readme-footer.md`, then re-run the sync script.
